## Context

Independent evidence track feeding 0729, programme 0725. Beneficiary countries
were not randomly selected; matching country/project characteristics cannot by
itself identify an effect. Reconstruct the assignment process and intervention
boundaries before committing to a causal claim.

## First documentary acceptance check

For one country, distinguish first documented negotiation, political declaration,
investment-plan publication and a dated support offer. A declaration date assumed
to rule out all anticipation must fail. A country considered but not concluding a
JETP must not automatically become an untreated or quasi-random control.

## Bounded actions

1. Use docs/jetp-scout-brief.md, adapted to country/partnership identity. Seek dated
   official G7/IPG/government statements, selection criteria, country partnership
   frameworks and public audit/parliamentary records. Secondary reporting is a
   lead to verify; document disagreements and unavailable originals.
2. First round: at most 20 source-search/retrieval calls or 90 minutes. Record
   exactly what new document/route could justify another round. No institutional
   messages are authorised by this ticket.
3. Build a chronology for four JETP countries and documented candidate/non-concluded
   countries. Distinguish selection on persistent conditions from expected future
   energy changes. Audit concurrent reforms, shared-lender reallocations and
   exposure of non-energy sectors or comparator countries.
4. Search separately for an actual support-allocation mechanism: rules, candidate
   lists, scores, thresholds or externally scheduled rollout. Do not infer an
   instrument from political relationships, or a discontinuity from an arbitrary
   date. State when no usable mechanism is established.

## Deliverables and exit criteria

- [x] Dated source-linked selection/negotiation/intervention chronology with uncertainties
- [x] Comparator admissibility matrix flags negotiations, parallel programmes and other exposure
- [x] Rival explanations and evidence distinguishing them from JETP treatment recorded
- [x] Any allocation-rule candidate supported by original rules and a list of remaining identification gaps
- [x] Go/narrow/defer implications for each candidate design; no assumption that a funnel establishes assignment

Unknown is a valid finding. These results guide 0729's definition of treatment,
time zero, eligible population and counterfactual; they do not estimate an effect.

